  "content": "<div style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 750px; margin: auto; font-family: 'Calibri', sans-serif; background: #fff; padding: 40px; border: 1px solid #eee; box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); position: relative;\"><div style=\"position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); z-index: 0;\"><img src=\"{{school_logo_url}}\" style=\"height: 300px; opacity: 0.08;\"></div><div style=\"position: relative; z-index: 1;\"><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;\"><h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; color: #333;\">{{school_name}}</h1><p style=\"margin: 5px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #666;\">{{school_address}}</p></div><div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;\"><h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; border-bottom: 2px solid #555; padding-bottom: 5px;\">BONAFIDE CERTIFICATE</h2></div><div style=\"font-size: 17px; line-height: 2; text-align: justify;\"><p>This is to certify that <strong>{{student_name}}</strong>, son/daughter of <strong>{{father_name}}</strong>, is a bonafide student of <strong>Class {{class_section}}</strong> in our school for the academic year <strong>{{academic_session}}</strong>.</p><p>According to the school's official records, his/her date of birth is <strong>{{dob}}</strong>.</p><p>This certificate is issued upon the parent's request for their personal use. We wish the student all the best for their future.</p></div><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; margin-top: 100px; font-size: 15px;\"><div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Date of Issue:</strong><br>{{current_date}}</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"{{student_photo_url}}\" style=\"height: 45px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; padding-top: 5px; font-weight: 600;\">Principal's Signature</p></div></div></div></div>",
